# =====================================================================
# Not deployed.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# The HTML is generated by build.py and committed, so the deployment is
# the output of the build, not the machinery that made it. These paths
# are how the site is built and checked; they are not the site, and there
# is no reason to publish them at a public address.
#
#   test/     68KB of browser test script, which names every check the
#             site has to pass. Anyone can read which way to break it.
#   tools/    the share card's source, and the only script that needs
#             Chrome. It runs on a machine, not on a server.
#   build.py  the generator. Its real content is the menu, which is
#             published on /menu anyway, but the script itself is not
#             something a restaurant serves.
#
# Deliberately NOT excluded, because the site serves them:
#   *.html  css/  js/  img/  fonts/  favicon.svg
#   umarhayatchaskapoint.png          the apple-touch-icon
#   umarhayatchaskapoint-trimmed.png  the og:image fallback
#   sitemap.xml  robots.txt  site.webmanifest  404.html  vercel.json
# =====================================================================

test/
tools/
build.py
README.md
img/README.md
